">kokoro</span><span begin="01:32.424" end="01:32.980">no</span><span begin="01:32.980" end="01:33.984"></span><span begin="01:35.021" end="01:35.777"></span><span begin="01:35.777" end="01:36.637">koodo</span><span begin="01:36.637" end="01:37.829">wo</span><span begin="01:38.671" end="01:40.175">yomito't</span><span begin="01:40.175" end="01:41.860">te</span></text><text for="L29"><span begin="01:45.858" end="01:47.688">kusa'ttana</span><span begin="01:47.688" end="01:48.895">'ttou</span><span begin="01:49.546" end="01:49.737"></span><span begin="01:49.737" end="01:50.390">mita</span><span begin="01:50.414" end="01:51.130">i</span><span begin="01:51.130" end="01:51.494">ni</span></text><text for="L30"><span begin="01:51.652" end="01:52.781">nebariketo</span><span begin="01:53.105" end="01:53.503">ita</span><span begin="01:53.503" end="01:54.132">ikena</span><span begin="01:54.386" end="01:55.153">kaori</span></text><text for="L31"><span begin="01:55.314" end="01:56.466">nakushitemo</span><span begin="01:56.656" end="01:58.130">kimitoitai</span><span begin="01:58.130" end="02:02.548">ya</span></text><text for="L32"><span begin="02:13.140" end="02:13.589">ame</span><span begin="02:13.589" end="02:14.436">tokidoki</span><span begin="02:14.436" end="02:15.194">nekojarashi</span></text><text for="L33"><span begin="02:15.335" end="02:15.767">totsuze</span><span begin="02:15.908" end="02:16.442">nkitaru</span><span begin="02:16.542" end="02:17.170">tenshi</span></text><text for="L36"><span begin="02:19.386" end="02:20.127">koimagure</span><span begin="02:20.267" end="02:20.853">nabiito</span><span begin="02:20.912" end="02:21.151">de</span></text><text for="L37"><span begin="02:21.212" end="02:21.825">naninu</span><span begin="02:21.909" end="02:22.796">nekojarashi</span></text><text for="L38"><span begin="02:22.710" end="02:23.465">erabare</span><span begin="02:23.508" end="02:23.889">tako</span><span begin="02:23.941" end="02:24.540">nodasai</span></text><text for="L40"><span begin="02:28.598" end="02:29.221">arifu</span><span begin="02:29.221" end="02:29.733">re</span><span begin="02:29.733" end="02:30.326">tamono</span><span begin="02:30.432" end="02:31.290">to'ppara't</span><span begin="02:31.290" end="02:31.865">te</span></text><text for="L41"><span begin="02:32.265" end="02:32.964">kimiwo</span><span begin="02:32.964" end="02:33.454">e</span><span begin="02:33.454" end="02:33.878">gao</span><span begin="02:33.878" end="02:34.892">nishitain</span><span begin="02:34.946" end="02:35.497">de</span></text><text for="L42"><span begin="02:35.998" end="02:36.598">arie</span><span begin="02:36.598" end="02:37.312">soude</span><span begin="02:37.312" end="02:38.481">ariena</span><span begin="02:38.682" end="02:39.198">ideizu</span></text><text for="L43"><span begin="02:39.428" end="02:40.974">kimitohanashi</span><span begin="02:40.974" end="02:42.071">tai</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="02:47.173"><div begin="00:00.917" end="02:42.071"><p begin="00:00.917" end="00:07.752" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.917" end="00:01.244">今</span><span begin="00:01.656" end="00:01.824">日</span><span begin="00:01.824" end="00:02.158">が</span><span begin="00:02.523" end="00:03.065">いち</span><span begin="00:03.407" end="00:03.958">ばん</span><span begin="00:04.522" end="00:06.300">綺麗な</span><span begin="00:06.300" end="00:07.752">私</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天的我是如此明艳美丽</span></p><p begin="00:08.285" end="00:15.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:08.285" end="00:08.613">とっ</span><span begin="00:08.972" end="00:09.368">ても</span> <span begin="00:09.863" end="00:10.494">ああとっ</span><span begin="00:10.761" end="00:11.278">ても</span> <span begin="00:12.026" end="00:13.736">恋をし</span><span begin="00:13.736" end="00:15.200">たから</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我已深深地 啊啊</span></p><p begin="00:30.051" end="00:31.678" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:30.051" end="00:31.375">そこらへんに生えている</span><span begin="00:31.375" end="00:31.678">草</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">路上随处都能看到野草</span></p><p begin="00:31.911" end="00:33.544" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:31.911" end="00:32.228">誰も</span><span begin="00:32.312" end="00:32.519">見</span><span begin="00:32.561" end="00:32.874">向きも</span><span begin="00:32.981" end="00:33.159">しない</span><span begin="00:33.171" end="00:33.544">草</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无人理睬那些杂草</span></p><p begin="00:33.811" end="00:37.219" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:33.811" end="00:34.568">君</span><span begin="00:34.568" end="00:35.898">に踏まれてる</span><span begin="00:35.898" end="00:36.795">エノコロ</span><span begin="00:36.845" end="00:37.219">グサ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">狗尾巴草正被你踩在脚下</span></p><p begin="00:37.507" end="00:39.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:37.507" end="00:37.819">いつか</span><span begin="00:37.819" end="00:38.546">将来は</span><span begin="00:38.546" end="00:39.070">君とさ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有朝一日要与你一起</span></p><p begin="00:39.398" end="00:44.628" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:39.398" end="00:40.826">人間に</span><span begin="00:40.826" end="00:41.468">なって</span><span begin="00:41.468" end="00:43.119">昼休</span><span begin="00:43.119" end="00:44.628">み</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化作人类后享受午休</span></p><p begin="00:45.193" end="00:46.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:45.193" end="00:45.601">本当は</span><span begin="00:45.689" end="00:45.993">もっと</span><span begin="00:46.060" end="00:46.462">撫でて</span><span begin="00:46.503" end="00:46.860">ほしっ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实多么希望你能抚摸我</span></p><p begin="00:47.060" end="00:48.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:47.060" end="00:47.504">カツオは</span><span begin="00:47.504" end="00:47.828">not</span><span begin="00:48.017" end="00:48.660">君がほしっ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比起鲣鱼我更加渴望你</span></p><p begin="00:48.892" end="00:50.489" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:48.892" end="00:49.721">デレよりツンが</span><span begin="00:49.785" end="00:50.489">日に日に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然傲的一面日复一日地</span></p><p begin="00:50.721" end="00:52.481" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:50.721" end="00:51.250">大</span><span begin="00:51.250" end="00:52.481">きくなるけど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">远远胜过了娇</span></p><p begin="00:52.549" end="00:54.183" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:52.549" end="00:53.506">恋心は</span><span begin="00:53.506" end="00:54.183">猫じゃらし</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但恋爱之心就是逗猫棒</span></p><p begin="00:54.449" end="00:57.682" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:54.449" end="00:55.323">恋心は</span><span begin="00:55.323" end="00:55.913">猫じゃらし</span><span begin="00:56.101" end="00:56.513">ｲｲ</span><span begin="00:56.972" end="00:57.682">ｲｲ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这颗恋爱之心就是逗猫棒</span></p><p begin="00:57.874" end="00:59.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:57.874" end="00:58.667">くすぐったいの</span><span begin="00:58.769" end="00:59.301">なんの</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样撩拨着我的心</span></p><p begin="00:59.337" end="01:01.391" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:59.337" end="00:59.786">雨</span><span begin="00:59.786" end="01:00.633">ときどき</span><span begin="01:00.633" end="01:01.391">猫じゃらし</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶有阵雨间转逗猫棒</span></p><p begin="01:01.495" end="01:03.415" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:01.495" end="01:02.018">突然</span><span begin="01:02.018" end="01:02.698">来たる</span><span begin="01:02.698" end="01:03.415">嵐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暴风雨突然侵袭而来 朝那边看去 嘿快来</span></p><p begin="01:03.687" end="01:04.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:03.687" end="01:04.580">あっちむいてほい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朝这边看来是恋爱 实在是手忙脚乱</span></p><p begin="01:04.610" end="01:06.853" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:04.610" end="01:05.466">こっち向いて恋</span> <span begin="01:05.570" end="01:06.853">大忙し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看向这边 恋 忙个不停</span></p><p begin="01:06.870" end="01:07.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:06.870" end="01:07.300">ナァーーーン！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(喵ーーー)</span></p><p begin="01:07.320" end="01:08.904" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:07.320" end="01:07.933">なにぬ</span><span begin="01:08.017" end="01:08.904">猫じゃらし</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哒嘀嘟逗猫棒</span></p><p begin="01:08.915" end="01:10.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:08.915" end="01:09.280">息する</span><span begin="01:09.449" end="01:09.929">たびに</span><span begin="01:10.099" end="01:10.817">ヲアイニー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次呼吸都在诉说爱你</span></p><p begin="01:10.838" end="01:14.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:10.838" end="01:11.102">恥</span><span begin="01:11.102" end="01:11.648">かいて</span><span begin="01:11.736" end="01:12.603">なんぼ</span><span begin="01:12.709" end="01:14.353">だい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">羞耻又算得了什么呢</span></p><p begin="01:14.395" end="01:16.486" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:14.395" end="01:15.915">鳴いて謝っても無駄</span> <span begin="01:16.109" end="01:16.486">(ナァン…)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕喵喵叫着道歉也是徒劳(喵)</span></p><p begin="01:16.242" end="01:17.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:16.242" end="01:16.567">昨日</span><span begin="01:16.567" end="01:16.888">あー</span><span begin="01:16.888" end="01:17.276">してい</span><span begin="01:17.276" end="01:17.873">タラレバ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与其假设昨天的另一种可能性</span></p><p begin="01:18.139" end="01:21.566" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:18.139" end="01:18.606">ネ</span><span begin="01:18.720" end="01:19.195">ガみは</span><span begin="01:19.282" end="01:20.603">揚げてしまお"</span><span begin="01:20.744" end="01:21.024">てん</span><span begin="01:21.165" end="01:21.566">ぷら"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不如干脆裹上面衣将其炸成“天妇罗”</span></p><p begin="01:21.832" end="01:23.361" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:21.832" end="01:22.093">いつか</span><span begin="01:22.131" end="01:22.648">将来の</span><span begin="01:22.819" end="01:23.122">ことは</span><span begin="01:23.122" end="01:23.361">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将来的事就等有朝一日</span></p><p begin="01:23.662" end="01:30.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:23.662" end="01:24.440">大</span><span begin="01:24.440" end="01:25.621">人になって</span><span begin="01:25.621" end="01:27.446">考えれば</span><span begin="01:27.446" end="01:29.466">い</span><span begin="01:29.466" end="01:30.870">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">长大成人之后再去考虑就好</span></p><p begin="01:31.361" end="01:41.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:31.361" end="01:32.424">心</span><span begin="01:32.424" end="01:32.980">の</span><span begin="01:32.980" end="01:33.984">Q</span><span begin="01:35.021" end="01:35.777">R</span><span begin="01:35.777" end="01:36.637">コード</span><span begin="01:36.637" end="01:37.829">を</span><span begin="01:38.671" end="01:40.175">読み取っ</span><span begin="01:40.175" end="01:41.860">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请扫描我心底的那个二维码</span></p><p begin="01:45.858" end="01:51.494" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:45.858" end="01:47.688">腐った納</span><span begin="01:47.688" end="01:48.895">豆</span><span begin="01:49.546" end="01:49.737">み</span><span begin="01:49.737" end="01:50.390">た</span><span begin="01:50.414" end="01:51.130">い</span><span begin="01:51.130" end="01:51.494">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同腐坏的纳豆那样</span></p><p begin="01:51.652" end="01:55.153" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:51.652" end="01:52.781">粘り気と</span><span begin="01:53.105" end="01:53.503">いた</span><span begin="01:53.503" end="01:54.132">いけな</span><span begin="01:54.386" end="01:55.153">香り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">透着粘稠感与惹人怜爱的气息</span></p><p begin="01:55.314" end="02:02.548" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:55.314" end="01:56.466">失くしても</span><span begin="01:56.656" end="01:58.130">君といたい</span><span begin="01:58.130" end="02:02.548">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕会历经失去也想与你相伴</span></p><p begin="02:13.140" end="02:15.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:13.140" end="02:13.589">雨</span><span begin="02:13.589" end="02:14.436">ときどき</span><span begin="02:14.436" end="02:15.194">猫じゃらし</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶有阵雨间转逗猫棒</span></p><p begin="02:15.335" end="02:17.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:15.335" end="02:15.767">突然</span><span begin="02:15.908" end="02:16.442">来たる</span><span begin="02:16.542" end="02:17.170">天使</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天使突然从天而降 朝那边看去 嘿快来</span></p><p begin="02:17.503" end="02:18.416" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:17.503" end="02:18.416">あっちむいてほい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朝这边看来是恋爱 以随心所欲的节拍</span></p><p begin="02:18.423" end="02:19.379" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:18.423" end="02:19.379">こっち向いて恋</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看向这边 恋</span></p><p begin="02:19.386" end="02:21.151" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:19.386" end="02:20.127">まぐれな</span><span begin="02:20.267" end="02:20.853">ビート</span><span begin="02:20.912" end="02:21.151">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踩着误打误撞的节拍</span></p><p begin="02:21.212" end="02:22.796" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:21.212" end="02:21.825">なにぬ</span><span begin="02:21.909" end="02:22.796">猫じゃらし</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哒嘀嘟逗猫棒</span></p><p begin="02:22.710" end="02:24.540" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:22.710" end="02:23.465">選ばれた</span><span begin="02:23.508" end="02:23.889">この</span><span begin="02:23.941" end="02:24.540">ダサい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命运选中的笨拙青春不存在标准答案</span></p><p begin="02:24.623" end="02:28.273" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:24.623" end="02:25.217">青春</span><span begin="02:25.395" end="02:25.627">に</span><span begin="02:25.627" end="02:26.531">解</span><span begin="02:26.531" end="02:28.031">な</span><span begin="02:28.031" end="02:28.273">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有标准答案</span></p><p begin="02:28.598" end="02:31.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:28.598" end="02:29.221">ありふ</span><span begin="02:29.221" end="02:29.733">れ</span><span begin="02:29.733" end="02:30.326">たもの</span><span begin="02:30.432" end="02:31.290">取っ払っ</span><span begin="02:31.290" end="02:31.865">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抛开那些平淡无奇的琐碎后</span></p><p begin="02:32.265" end="02:35.497" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:32.265" end="02:32.964">君を</span><span begin="02:32.964" end="02:33.454">笑</span><span begin="02:33.454" end="02:33.878">顔</span><span begin="02:33.878" end="02:34.892">にしたいん</span><span begin="02:34.946" end="02:35.497">です</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只想让你绽放笑容</span></p><p begin="02:35.998" end="02:39.198" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="02:35.998" end="02:36.598">ありえ</span><span begin="02:36.598" end="02:37.312">そうで</span><span begin="02:37.312" end="02:38.481">ありえない</span><span begin="02:38.682" end="02:39.198">デイズ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这段看似可能却难以企及的日子</span></p><p begin="02:39.428" end="02:42.071" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="02:39.428" end="02:40.974">君と話した</span><span begin="02:40.974" end="02:42.071">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想跟你聊聊天</span></p></div></body></tt>